message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "FerroCHART"
abstract: >-
  A pure-Rust openEHR form builder and renderer. It compiles an operational
  template into a form definition, renders that form for a clinician, and
  turns the entered values back into a COMPOSITION committed to any openEHR
  CDR over the ITS-REST API.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Ruben
    family-names: Talstra
license: BUSL-1.1
repository-code: "https://github.com/rubentalstra/FerroCHART"
url: "https://ferrochart.eu"
keywords:
  - openEHR
  - clinical forms
  - archetype
  - operational template
  - Rust
version: 0.1.0
